cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "het-ai"
abstract: >-
  A framework-agnostic MLOps training DSL for Python that provides a structured
  abstraction over the full machine learning training lifecycle — data loading,
  hyperparameter optimisation (HPO), model training, export, and experiment
  tracking — through a single, consistent interface, powered by Optuna and
  integrated with DVC data versioning and MLflow experiment tracking.
